        {
          "ruleId": "sunset/sql_injection",
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "058_05.php 登录查询 username 参数 SQL 注入（CWE-89）\n\n攻击者通过 HTTP 请求的 query 参数 `username` 输入（058_05.php:25 读取），该值未经任何转义或参数化即被拼接进 SQL 语句：058_05.php:30 `$sql = \"select count(*) from users where username='$username'\"`，随后在 058_05.php:31 交由 `mysql_query($sql)` 执行。由于 `$username` 被直接放入单引号字符串上下文，攻击者可闭合引号并注入任意 SQL 片段（如 `' OR '1'='1`、`' UNION SELECT ...`），校验完全缺失，污点直达数据库执行汇点。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "058_05.php"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 29,
                  "endLine": 31
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "sunsetFindingId": "GEN-b07a62da291f"
          },
          "properties": {
            "finding_id": "GEN-b07a62da291f",
            "confidence": 0.83,
            "verdict": "candidate",
            "evidence_level": "rule_verified+llm",
            "cwe": "CWE-89",
            "endpoint": "/058_05",
            "http_method": "ANY",
            "has_poc": true,
            "origin": "rule"
          }
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "sunset/sql_injection",
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "058_06.php 登录认证 username/password 参数 SQL 注入（CWE-89）\n\n攻击者通过 query 参数 `login_user` 相关输入（058_06.php:20 读取 `$username`、`$password`）提交数据，二者未经转义直接拼接进认证 SQL：058_06.php:22 `$sql = \"SELECT * FROM users WHERE username='$username' and password='$password'\"`，在 058_06.php:24 由 `mysql_query($sql)` 执行。单引号上下文可被闭合，攻击者可用 `' OR '1'='1' -- ` 之类载荷绕过口令校验，或以 UNION 注入读取任意数据。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "058_06.php"
                },
                "region": {
