            "confidence": 0.83,
            "verdict": "candidate",
            "evidence_level": "rule_verified+llm",
            "cwe": "CWE-89",
            "endpoint": "/058_06",
            "http_method": "ANY",
            "has_poc": true,
            "origin": "rule"
          }
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "sunset/sql_injection",
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "058_08.php 修改口令 current_password 参数 SQL 注入（CWE-89）\n\n攻击者在修改口令流程中通过 query 参数 `current_password`（058_08.php:32 读取 `$curr_pass`，同时涉及 `$username`、`$pass`）提交输入，未经转义即拼接进 UPDATE 语句：058_08.php:38 `$sql = \"UPDATE users SET PASSWORD='$pass' where username='$username' and password='$curr_pass' \"`，在 058_08.php:39 由 `mysql_query($sql)` 执行。攻击者可闭合引号注入，篡改 WHERE 条件或追加语句，从而在不知道原口令的情况下修改任意用户口令。"
          },
          "locations": [
